# Feature parity with WinTAKTracker

AndroidTAKTracker is the Android sibling of WinTAKTracker. Shared **Feature IDs** live in `docs/feature-parity.md`.

## Rules

- Do not rename or remove a Feature ID without updating both repos.
- New cross-product capabilities need a new Feature ID row in both matrices.
- **VIDEO** on Android is **N/A** — document ICU VideoStreamer (or successor) as the companion; do not reintroduce in-app video without an explicit product decision.
- CI workflow `parity-drift.yml` compares Feature IDs against `CopIXus/WinTAKTracker` — keep the script green.

## Status vocabulary

Use Yes / Partial / Planned / N/A consistently in the parity table.
